                                                "sense_id": "3a5358c0-7c6d-393c-b7a2-bb57ab166e9f",
                                                "text": "The captain, `Papa Viggo,´ as he is called among the islands, is a fair-haired man, rather under average height, and with a tendency towards rotundity."
                                            }
                                        ]
